From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:37:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wbemprox: Implement Win32_Process.Terminate.

The reason is the exit code the process is given; the method answers 0,
or 2 when access is denied and 8 for any other failure, as the class
documents.  The test also checks another process's command line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

